Package: rsemflow
Type: Package
Title: Metadata-Driven Downstream Analysis for RSEM Gene-Level Results
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("RSEMflow", "Developers", email = "maintainer@rsemflow.local", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A command-line and R interface for reproducible downstream analysis
    of RSEM gene-level expression estimates. RSEMflow imports '*.genes.results'
    files together with ordinary sample metadata, computes expression-level
    quality summaries, normalization, principal component analysis, sample
    correlation, DESeq2 differential expression, preranked GSEA, GSVA or
    ssGSEA pathway scores, and Ensembl gene annotation. The package produces
    tabular outputs only and does not generate figures.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: false
Depends:
    R (>= 4.3.0)
Imports:
